<h2 id="includes">What This Service Includes</h2>
<p>Many of the patients who benefit from regenerative care come through personal-injury and musculoskeletal channels, which brings its own financial mechanics — liens, documentation, and timing. We help you manage those well while keeping the program efficient and sensibly priced.</p>

<h3>What We Focus On</h3>
<div class="dash-list">
